    "Answer A (Therapy First Default): Start with CBT or another evidence-based therapy \u2014 for mild to moderate symptoms it's as effective as medication without side effects, builds lasting coping skills, and is recommended as first-line by most clinical guidelines.",
    "Answer B (Medication for Speed): Start with an SSRI if you need faster relief or have moderate-to-severe symptoms \u2014 antidepressants typically show effect in 2\u20134 weeks versus months for therapy to fully work.",
    "Answer C (Combined Approach): Pursue therapy and medication simultaneously \u2014 the combination outperforms either alone for persistent or moderate-severe cases and is recommended when symptoms are significantly impairing daily function."
